{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose one of three game modes: develop a legitimate career as a train driver, fight for survival at all costs, or take a job for the Soviet mafia and discover the dark story of the railway underworld.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/996cbdcf3f1e8f95201d4feab76500e7.poster.avif?t=1764004477\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/996cbdcf3f1e8f95201d4feab76500e7.webm?t=1764004477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/996cbdcf3f1e8f95201d4feab76500e7.mp4?t=1764004477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the grim realities of the late '80s, where a powerful locomotive is your home, means of transport, and tool for earning money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the tutorial, one mafia mission, and the first kilometers of the route for free.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prologue features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed VL10 locomotive driving simulation</strong> - simplified but authentic controls and procedures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Railway traffic</strong> - obey signs and signals, and avoid derailments or damage to locomotive parts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repairs &amp; Maintenance</strong> - manage parts that wear out as you drive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspections</strong> - monitor the condition of parts to replace them on time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job &amp; Economy</strong> - earn money by transporting cargo.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong> - buy food, tools, locomotive parts, weapons, and ammunition; <span class=\"bb_strike\">sell trophies, meat, and scrap.</span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Hunting</strong></span> <strong>&amp; Combat</strong> - use weapons for <span class=\"bb_strike\">hunting</span> and self-defense.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Law &amp; Order</strong> - the militia maintains order, civilians defend their resources.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival System</strong> - manage hunger, thirst, illness, hypothermia, alcohol, and hangover stats to stay alive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather &amp; Day\u2013night cycle</strong> \u2013 snowstorms, frosts, nights, and winds affect visibility.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route</strong> - Route - a section spanning several kilometers through Novosibirsk. Buy the full version, which offers about 840 km in 1:1 scale and many places and activities to discover.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2248950?t=1764004477","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764004477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764004477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764004477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose one of three game modes: develop